Dear Karen,

 

I hope you are well.

 

Please could you pass this on to the judge.

 

Thank you very much.

 

With kind wishes,

 

Nadia

 

Dear Judge,

 

 

I intend to prepare an application to appeal the judgement, and an application for a Non-Molestation order.

 

I am unable to prepare these without legal counsel and I do not have any financial resources to pay for my legal advice.

 

Furthermore, the respondent has not made the payments under the MPS order, and the children and I have been subjected to his coercive control and financial abuse for four years. 

 

Finally, I do not speak with the respondent and will not have any contact with him for the rest of my life. I will not discuss any financial matters with him and will not be able to prepare court orders without legal representation. I will address these issues in my appeal application and shall start as soon as I have funding for my legal representation. 

 

Sincerely,

 

Nadia Zahmoul

 

 

Veritas Numquam Perit

UK: +44 79 1332 8615

US: +1 424 426 9226

 

 

 

 


